{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4658": "ALEXANDRA: （试着点火看看……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4659": "ALEXANDRA: （好了！）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4660": "DURAND: 发动了！干得好！我这就能走了吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4661": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……算是吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4662": "ALEXANDRA: 其实，问题不在电路上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4663": "ALEXANDRA: 大部分部件都还完好，只是发电机皮带和驱动端轴承得换新的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4664": "DURAND: 你修不了？你不是上过技校吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4665": "MRS. DURAND: 阿兰！人家是在帮我们忙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4666": "DURAND: 这不算帮忙，上一批货的钱，她还欠着呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4667": "MRS. DURAND: 阿兰！（你知道她妈妈出了什么事……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4668": "DURAND: 哦，对，你妈妈怎么样了？醒了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4669": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4670": "DURAND: 她肯定会醒的，医生全是蠢货，他们的话不能信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4671": "DURAND: 总之，我给你留了一箱上好的雷内特苹果，半价，一小时后给你送过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4672": "ALEXANDRA: 谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexColdOpen-4673": "ALEXANDRA: （妈妈怎么能应付这么多人，还腾得出时间做晚饭……？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-neighborAlert-4674": "NEIGHBOR: 亚历珊德拉？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-neighborAlert-4675": "ALEXANDRA: 哦，您好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-neighborAlert-4676": "NEIGHBOR: 店里出了点事，你舅舅正在找你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-neighborAlert-4677": "ALEXANDRA: （糟了……又怎么了……？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-neighborAlert-4678": "LOUIS: 亚历？是冷藏库出问题了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-neighborAlert-4679": "ALEXANDRA: 怎么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-neighborAlert-4680": "LOUIS: 你先去看看，好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-afterCratePuzzle-4681": "ALEXANDRA: 等等，大家都去哪儿了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-afterCratePuzzle-4682": "LOUIS: 大部分鸡肉我卖掉了，剩下能塞多少就往冷藏柜里塞了多少。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-afterCratePuzzle-4683": "ALEXANDRA: 牛奶会最先坏。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-afterCratePuzzle-4684": "LOUIS: 去问问吉鲁夫人？她有几个孩子来着，六个？把牛奶搬过去卖给她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-afterCratePuzzle-4685": "LOUIS: 我留下看店，免得有客人来了没人招呼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexStart-4686": "ALVIN: 把围栏的口子补好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexStart-4687": "ALVIN: 只要没发现围栏被剪过，他们就不会知道我们来过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexStart-4688": "ALVIN: 亚历，快点行不行！？可没一整晚给我们磨蹭。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexStart-4689": "ALEXANDRA: 好了，应该牢靠了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexStart-4690": "ALVIN: 很好，进仓库干完就回家，时间就是钱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-girouxMilk-4691": "ALEXANDRA: 吉鲁夫人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-girouxMilk-4692": "MRS. GIROUX: 亚历珊德拉？你没事吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-girouxMilk-4693": "ALEXANDRA: 我有……抱歉，让我喘口气……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-girouxMilk-4694": "ALEXANDRA: 我有半价的牛奶，一共八升……不好意思，是挺多的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-girouxMilk-4695": "MRS. GIROUX: 不多，亲爱的，我家两天就能喝完，等我叫儿子们来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-girouxMilk-4696": "MRS. GIROUX: 克洛德！勒内！出来把牛奶搬进去！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-girouxMilk-4697": "MRS. GIROUX: 钱给你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-girouxMilk-4698": "MRS. GIROUX: 你妈妈怎么样？好点了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-girouxMilk-4699": "ALEXANDRA: 我得走了，还得赶着把其他东西卖掉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-girouxMilk-4700": "ALEXANDRA: （得抓紧，肉要坏了。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-girouxMilk-4701": "ALEXANDRA: （妈妈也一个人待了这么久……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-louisMeat-4702": "LOUIS: 亚历，这肉都往外渗水了……你能拿个那种袋子来吗？就是……用什么做的来着？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-louisMeat-4703": "ALEXANDRA: 塑料？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-louisMeat-4704": "ALEXANDRA: 储藏室还有几个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4705": "ALEXANDRA: （什么都找不到，妈妈是怎么把这里收拾得井井有条的？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4706": "ALEXANDRA: （真得去看看她了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4707": "ALEXANDRA: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4708": "ALEXANDRA: 阿尔文？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4709": "ALVIN: 你在这里干什么？谁在照顾妈妈？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4710": "ALEXANDRA: 我只是……来拿塑料袋，早上已经给妈妈洗过澡了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4711": "ALEXANDRA: 冷藏库坏了，我们得趁肉还没——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4712": "ALVIN: 亚历，这根本没意义。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4713": "ALEXANDRA: 什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4714": "ALEXANDRA: 阿尔文！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4715": "ALVIN: 守着这家店赚不了钱，我都跟你说了几个月了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4716": "ALVIN: 真想赚钱，就来跟我干。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4717": "ALEXANDRA: 先帮我们把这些东西搬出去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4718": "MAN: 嘿，阿尔文，我实在需要——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4719": "ALVIN: 我是怎么跟你说的？嗯！？不准来这里买！绝对不准！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4720": "YOUNG MAN: 我就……我就要一点。求你了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4721": "ALVIN: 再让我在这里看见你，以后就别想从我这儿买东西！听见没有！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4722": "ALVIN: 现在给我滚！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4723": "ALVIN: 照顾妈妈的护士来了就告诉我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4724": "ALVIN: 我过会儿回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4725": "ALEXANDRA: （都这时候了，他为什么还要这样？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4726": "LOUIS: 亚历，把这肉装好，送去达尔诺夫人那里吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-bagStorage-4727": "LOUIS: 她好像有个老式冰柜，价格合适的话，也许能全买下来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexCrateMeat-4728": "ALEXANDRA: （不，这块不行……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexCrateMeat-4729": "ALEXANDRA: （已经有一点味儿了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexCrateMeat-4730": "ALEXANDRA: （好，专心点，继续干。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-alexCrateMeat-4731": "ALEXANDRA: （达尔诺夫人就住在隔壁。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4732": "ALEXANDRA: 有人吗？达尔诺夫人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4733": "YOUNG MAN: 哪位？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4734": "ALEXANDRA: 您好，呃，您……奶奶在家吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4735": "YOUNG MAN: 她正在花园里休息。有什……等等，你是玛丽的女儿，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4736": "YOUNG MAN: 她怎么样了？你还好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4737": "ALEXANDRA: 我，呃，带了一些肉来，正在打折……您奶奶吃肉的吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4738": "YOUNG MAN: 哦，她吃的牛排可不少，简直像是准备去当拳击手。多少钱？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4739": "ALEXANDRA: 这一整箱，一百二十。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4740": "YOUNG MAN: 嗯……是挺多的，不过……行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4741": "YOUNG MAN: 来得正好，奶奶喜欢早点吃饭。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4742": "ALEXANDRA: 等等，现在几点了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4743": "YOUNG MAN: 三点半。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4744": "ALEXANDRA: （等等！怎么就三点半了！？妈妈已经一个人待了——）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4745": "ALEXANDRA: 唔……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4746": "ALEXANDRA: 等等，我在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4747": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 在我的花园里，亲爱的，你晕倒了，朱尔斯把你抱出来透透气。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4748": "ALEXANDRA: 哦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4749": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 听说你妈妈的事，我很难过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4750": "ALEXANDRA: 每个人都想聊这个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4751": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 那也许，你也该说说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4752": "ALEXANDRA: 我不知道妈妈怎么能做那么多事，她总说，“优秀是一种习惯”，好像这么一句话就全解释清了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4753": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 你舅舅和阿尔文没帮忙吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4754": "ALEXANDRA: 舅舅一直在帮忙，可我哥他……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4755": "ALEXANDRA: 倒也不是一点忙都不帮，他会出钱分担开销，可就是不肯帮着照看店里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4756": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 一家人一起做生意，总有这些难处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4757": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 我丈夫去世那会儿，我也只能暂时收起悲伤，接着打理他留下的生意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4758": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 这当然不公平，可我还能怎么办呢？难道就这么放弃？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4759": "ALEXANDRA: 可我们还得继续照顾妈妈，我真的不知道该怎么办了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4760": "ALEXANDRA: 每次好不容易把事情做顺手了，养成了“习惯”，就又有新的麻烦冒出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4761": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 我给你讲讲我曾祖母的故事吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4762": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 她的父亲乔治是个农民，那时候，人们还会用魔法恢复地力，让庄稼长得更快。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4763": "ALEXANDRA: 那……是真的？我还以为那些魔法都是故事呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4764": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 谁说得准呢？反正我认识的农民都信，可乔治老爹不像邻居们那样有魔法天赋，所以很穷。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4765": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 他很勤劳，但除了养活家人，也攒不下什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4766": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 然后有一天，大家醒来就发现魔法消失了，谁都再也用不了了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4767": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 可乔治老爹本来就会不靠魔法种地，世界从那天起变了样，他反而过得好了，还雇了邻居来帮忙，让整个村子都有饭吃。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4768": "ALEXANDRA: 那时候不是……不是闹过一场大饥荒吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4769": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 哦，当然闹过，可多亏乔治老爹，我们一家人都挺过来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4770": "MRS. D'ARNAUD: 所以说啊，日子往后会变成什么样，谁也说不准。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4771": "ALVIN: 亚历？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4772": "ALEXANDRA: 阿尔文？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4773": "ALVIN: 没事吧？他们说你晕倒了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4774": "ALEXANDRA: 嗯，我没事，得回店里去看妈妈了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4775": "ALVIN: 亚历，真想赚钱，就不能光守着店。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4776": "ALEXANDRA: 我不会……你知道的，我不卖……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4777": "ALVIN: 我没叫你干那个，只要你帮我们弄几台机器。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4778": "ALEXANDRA: 阿尔文……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-deliverMeat-4779": "ALVIN: 这个世界就是这样，亚历，你不可能什么事都按自己的心意来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-goBackPrologue-4780": "ALEXANDRA: （得去看看冷藏库。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-goBackPrologue-4781": "ALEXANDRA: （得趁牛奶还没坏，赶紧送过去。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-goBackPrologue-4782": "ALEXANDRA: （去找找袋子。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-goBackPrologue-4783": "ALEXANDRA: （别打扰妈妈了。得去找达尔诺夫人。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-radioInspection-4784": "ALEXANDRA: 收音机好像坏了……晚点再修吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-prologueBackToStore-4785": "ALEXANDRA: （得去找达尔诺夫人。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-prologueBackToStore-4786": "ALEXANDRA: （得赶快回店里。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-boxReminder-4787": "LOUIE: 亚历，别忘了箱子！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-boxReminder2-4788": "LOUIE: 亚历，肉！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/alex/alexPrologue.yarn-boxReminder3-4789": "LOUIE: 亚历！冷藏库！"
}
